WEBVTT

00:01:59.782 --> 00:02:04.036
our critical infrastructure
and so much more.

00:02:04.495 --> 00:02:07.415
For 40 million people in my country

00:02:07.415 --> 00:02:10.209
and for billions around the globe,

00:02:10.209 --> 00:02:14.797
February 24 is the day
Russia invaded Ukraine.

00:02:15.464 --> 00:02:18.134
For seven million Ukrainian children,

00:02:18.176 --> 00:02:22.096
it is also the day
Russia tried to take their future.

00:02:23.139 --> 00:02:28.561
176 children have been killed
by Russian bombs.

00:02:28.978 --> 00:02:31.272
Hundreds more have been wounded.